bp?t=1777522147\" width=615 height=49 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/b05c636dcf77932807b6d964fd82b24c.poster.avif?t=1777522147\" width=614 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/b05c636dcf77932807b6d964fd82b24c.webm?t=1777522147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/b05c636dcf77932807b6d964fd82b24c.mp4?t=1777522147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>At night, 40 different types of monsters will emerge, launching frenzied attacks. On the final night, the map's ultimate boss will personally descend—prepare for an epic showdown!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/f652681917818297079031234ffaeb58.webp?t=1777522147\" width=615 height=49 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/1130568c6bfb4ad2469bd95c708d1d2d.poster.avif?t=1777522147\" width=614 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/1130568c6bfb4ad2469bd95c708d1d2d.webm?t=1777522147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648260/extras/1130568c6bfb4ad2469bd95c708d1d2d.mp4?t=1777522147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>9 distinct maps, each with rising difficulty, will test your tactics and decisions. Challenge higher difficulties and unlock more possibilities!","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX960<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Casual","Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Candlelight Studio"],"publishers":["Candlelight Studio"],"release_date":"Feb 27, 2026"}